{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1881","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Anya and the Mysterious String"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Anya received a string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ brought from Rome. The string $$$s$$$ consists of lowercase Latin letters and at first glance does not raise any suspicions. An instruction was attached to the string."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Start of the instruction."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A palindrome is a string that reads the same from left to right and right to left. For example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"anna"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aboba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"level"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are palindromes, while the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"gorilla"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"banan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"off"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A substring $$$[l \\ldots r]$$$ of string $$$s$$$ is a string $$$s_l s_{l+1} \\ldots s_{r-1} s_r$$$. For example, the substring $$$[4 \\ldots 6]$$$ of the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"generation"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"era"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A string is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"does not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" contain a substring of length "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at least"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" two that is a palindrome. For example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fox"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcdef"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yioy"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", while the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"xyxx"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yikjkitrb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"When an integer $$$x$$$ is added to the character $$$s_i$$$, it is replaced $$$x$$$ times with the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"next"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" character in the alphabet, with \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" being replaced by \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"When an integer $$$x$$$ is added to the substring $$$[l, r]$$$ of string $$$s$$$, it becomes the string $$$s_1 s_2 \\ldots s_{l-1} (s_l + x) (s_{l+1} + x) \\ldots (s_{r-1} + x) (s_r + x) s_{r+1} \\ldots s_n$$$. For example, when the substring $$$[2, 4]$$$ of the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abazaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is added with the number $$$6$$$, the resulting string is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ahgfaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"End of the instruction."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After reading the instruction, Anya resigned herself to the fact that she has to answer $$$m$$$ queries. The queries can be of two types:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Add the number $$$x$$$ to the substring $$$[l \\ldots r]$$$ of string $$$s$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Determine whether the substring $$$[l \\ldots r]$$$ of string $$$s$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) - the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The descriptions of the test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\le n, m \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) - the length of the string $$$s$$$ and the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains the string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$, consisting of lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next $$$m$$$ lines contain the queries:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$ $$$l$$$ $$$r$$$ $$$x$$$ ($$$1 \\le l \\le r \\le n$$$, $$$1 \\le x \\le 10^9$$$) - description of a query of the first type; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$2$$$ $$$l$$$ $$$r$$$ ($$$1 \\le l \\le r \\le n$$$) - description of a query of the second type. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ and the sum of $$$m$$$ over all test cases "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"do not exceed"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query of the second type, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if the substring $$$[l \\ldots r]$$$ of string $$$s$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", otherwise output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" in any case (for example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will be recognized as positive answers)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n12 8\ntedubcyyxopz\n2 2 5\n1 4 8 2\n2 1 7\n1 3 5 40\n1 9 11 3\n1 10 10 9\n2 4 10\n2 10 12\n10 4\nubnxwwgzjt\n2 4 10\n2 10 10\n1 6 10 8\n2 7 7\n11 3\nhntcxfxyhtu\n1 4 6 1\n2 4 10\n1 4 10 21\n13 2\nyxhlmzfhqctir\n1 5 9 3\n1 8 13 15\n2 3\nbp\n1 1 2 15\n1 1 2 18\n1 2 2 1000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case of the first test, the following happens:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"t"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"edub"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"cyyxopz"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":": the string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"edub"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ted"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ubcyy"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"xopz"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\to$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tedwdeaaxopz"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"}